# 15
define_match won_258, ~m"(2m@winning_tile 5m@winning_tile 8m@winning_tile 2p@winning_tile 5p@winning_tile 8p@winning_tile 2s@winning_tile 5s@winning_tile 8s@winning_tile):1"
define_yaku meta_yaku, "_no_terminals", [0, "Fan"], has_existing_yaku("Nine Gates") and not_match(["winning_tile"], ["won_258"]), ["Pung of Terminals", "_no_terminals"]

on after_initialization do
  delete_rule("Rules", "Non-Repeat Principle")
  delete_rule("Rules", "Exclusionary Rule")
  add_rule("Rules", "Mahjong International League Scoring", """
  From less niche to more niche:
  1. Fan guaranteeing a concealed hand cannot score Concealed Hand (2 han) or Fully Concealed Hand (4 fan).
  2. Waiting on any 2+ tiles, including "fifth tile" waits, invalidates Edge/Closed/Single Wait (1 fan).
  3. Any fan that need 3+ honor sets or 4+ same-suit sets also scores One Voided Suit (1 fan). Reversible Tiles (8 fan) cannot score with One Voided Suit (1 fan).
  4. Only one Kong-based fan and one Concealed Pung-based fan can be scored, but Two Concealed Kongs (6 fan) overrides Two Concealed Pungs (2 fan).
  5. All Chows (2 fan) can score max 3 fan from Pure Double Chow (1 fan), Mixed Double Chow (1 fan), Two Terminal Chows (1 fan), and Short Straight (1 fan).
  6. Otherwise, max 2 fan can be scored from those.
  7. Fan that use three chows can only score with max 1 fan from those.
  8. Fan that use four chows cannot score any of those fan.
  9. Seven Pairs (24 fan) cannot score with fan utilizing chows/pungs/kongs, or with any of: Seven Shifted Pairs (88 fan), Out with Replacement Tile (8 fan), Robbing The Kong (8 fan), Outside Hand (4 fan), Last Tile (4 fan), or Single Wait (1 fan).
  10. Fan that require terminal pungs do not score Pung of Terminals (1 fan). Fan that require honor pungs do not score Pung of Honors (1 fan). Big Four Winds (88 fan) does not score with Seat Wind (2 fan) or Prevalent Wind (2 fan). Big Three Dragons (88 fan) and Little Three Dragons (64 fan) do not score with Dragon Pung (2 fan).
  11. Knitted Straight (12 fan) can be included in a standard hand to score All Chows (2 fan). If the final wait coincides with the knitted straight's final wait, it does not invalidate Edge/Closed/Single Wait (1 fan).
  12. All Pungs (6 fan) cannot be scored with All Honors (64 fan), All Terminals and Honors (32 fan), and All Terminals (64 fan).
  13. All Green (88 fan) can score with Full Flush (24 fan) but not Half Flush (6 fan).
  14. All Terminals (64 fan) can score with Triple Pung (16 fan) but not Double Pung (2 fan).
  15. Nine Gates (88 fan) cannot score with Pung of Terminals (1 fan) unless won on a 2, 5, or 8.
  """, -1)
end
